OL,3,GNEWSACricket legend backs memorial
OL,4,Amatch for Covid victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of cricket's most celebrated
OL,7,Fbatsmen says an annual memorial match
OL,8,Fis helping a family celebrate the life
OL,9,Fof a much-loved player while bringing
OL,10,Fpeople together.
OL,12,FLee Nurse, a former captain of both
OL,13,FBasingstoke and Finchampstead Cricket
OL,14,FClubs, died in hospital with Covid-19
OL,15,Faged 43 in April 2020.
OL,17,FThe annual Lee Nurse Memorial Match
OL,18,Ftakes place at May's Bounty in
OL,19,FBasingstoke, Hampshire, on Sunday, with
OL,20,FWest Indies and Hampshire legend Sir
OL,21,FGordon Greenidge attending as guest of
OL,22,Fhonour.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
