OL,3,GNEWSACricket legend backs memorial
OL,4,Amatch for Covid victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Gordon said he continues to back
OL,7,Fthe event because of his longstanding
OL,8,Ffriendship with the family and the way
OL,9,Fit keeps Nurse's memory alive.
